Z||000000||Fierochic88||09-06-2001||11:40 AM||||It was assumed that I was not offended by the comparison in "Nude Babe on a Fiero"  well I was...quite a bit...and this is why:<P>First of all, someone commented that if I was offended, I would have said something.  Well, I would have said something for sure had I seen it, but given the limited time I have had lately on this Forum, why would I, especially being female, even bother to click on that topic?  Most guys on here probably wouln't post on a topic that said "Nude Guy on a Fiero."<P>Second, my dad is a member of this forum.  He doesn't post all too often, but he does read stuff almost every day.  How would you feel if someone talked about your daughter in such a manner?  I know some of you guys out there have kids or even sisters or wives and wouldn't appreciate them being tossed around a topic in such a manner.<P>Finally, my boyfriend is also a member on here.  In fact, he's the one that alerted me to the problem in the first place because someone mentioned it to him so he checked it out.  Now, I know everyone's gonna say "well why didn't he defend you", well he was too speechless to say anything, especially something semi-polite.<P>Thanks to everyone who defended me since I obviously wasn't there to defend myself.  And for those of you that took part in it, hey maybe I should be flattered, but personally my character and morals are a little above that, as anyone on here who knows me will attest to.  I know you're all gonna try and apologize, which I appreciate, but what I would appreciate more is if you could go back and delete your contributions to it, through the use of the edit button, especially when that photo is involved.  Now I know this is a free country and you guyz can all say what you want, I'm just telling you what would mean something to me.  You can interpret it however you want.<P>Jennifer||||reg||1
Z||000001||onfire||09-06-2001||02:31 PM||||Please forgive me as I had a momentary lapse in judgement when I posted that picture. I meant no harm to you or anyone else that I may have offended. My sincere apologies. The picture has been removed from my post and replaced with a link to this thread. <P>I know that sounds like a cheap apology, but I always had trouble explaining myself. And expressing my feelings on paper or in this case the computer. I am truly sorry.||||reg||11
