Z||000031||LZeitgeist||09-06-2001||07:55 PM||||Just to add that having only met you once at W'burg, I knew that you were not the type of person who would pose for the type of photo that was posted, but the fact that you wouldn't pose for it is actually where the humor lay during the time it was thought humorous. <P>I honestly don't think that anyone here actually thought that you would ever do that sort of thing, but we shouldn't have assumed that you would find it humorous. I'm sure now that we know better, the thread will be edited out of existence.<p>[This message has been edited by LZeitgeist (edited 09-06-2001).]||||reg||1
