Z||000033||Monkeyman||09-06-2001||08:32 PM||||So this is what I miss when I don't take time to cruise the forum carefully?  I gotta take more time here (just been surfing at work lately and don't want my boss to catch me).<P>Here's my take on the thing.  I enjoyed the original series of pics.  And...I think that whomever it was the posted a pic of Fierochic888 was wrong.  There is a vague resemblance (did I spell that wrong?), but Fierochic is attractive and the girl on the Fiero looks slutty.  No comparison there.  Last, but not least...JohnnyK---Go away.<P>------------------<BR>'Consciousness:  That annoying time between naps.'<P>MM||||reg||1
Z||000034||firstfiero||09-06-2001||08:49 PM||||     Mach10 this is directed twoard you. Just for the record sexuall harasment is something that takes place in the work place. In other words if I came up to a female in a mall and hit on her or made a sexuall remark their isn't anything she could do about except tell me to beat it. Now if I follow her around and continue, it would be considered plain old harrasment but not sexuall harrasment. The difference is simple...in the work place if I make one unwanted sexuall comment you could have me fired and also sue for sexual harrasment. In the world outside of work and certanly on a computer message board sexual harrasment...leagaly.... doesn't exist. <BR>    Now as for the picture If your offended I'm sorry. I still find it funny. Just because your a women doesn't mean you would immediatly be disgusted. Almost all of my women friends including my wife would find it funny... different kind of sense of humor. As for If it was about my daughter it depends... If it happened now at the age of 12 I would be upset. If it happened to her as an adult as I believe you are I would laugh at it. We are all different we all laugh at different stuff.<P>------------------<BR><BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/firstfiero.gif"> ||||reg||1
